ms also benefit from simple layouts, good lighting and durable modern finishes.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Calm Home to Come Back To</h2>\n            <p>After a long day, a clean and well-organised home feels like a relief. Good modern interior design creates that calm, every day.</p><p>Thinking of a modern look for your Chhattarpur home? <a href=\"/chhattarpur/contact\">Connect with 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}